é es bueno.","poem":1},{"text":"Su amorosa bondad perdura para siempre,","poem":2},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"su fidelidad a todas las generaciones.","poem":2}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/spa_blm/PSA/100.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/spa_blm/PSA/101.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/spa_blm/PSA/99.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":5}